<title>DUBAI: Sharjah air cargo volumes rise 14.5 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Sharjah air cargo volumes rise 14.5 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose a year-on-year 14.5 percent in August to almost 28,398 tonnes from 24,810 tonnes in August 1995.</p>
<p>This was higher than the 26,232 tonnes handled in July 1996.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose 19 percent in the month to 2,805 tonnes from 2,349 tonnes the previous August. In July Sharjah airport handled 3,329 tonnes of sea-air exports.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom, +9714-626990</p>
</text>
